Description: local control center for Linux single-board computers
 rsetup-next provides one typed control plane for observing and managing a
 Linux single-board computer. It includes a scriptable command-line interface,
 an interactive terminal interface, and a loopback Web control center.
 .
 Mutating operations are dry-run by default and require explicit live execution
 and confirmation.
